            </note>
            <note corresp="#d91-f2" n="2" xml:id="d91-f2-content">
                <p>Title II of S. 2525 was entitled Intelligence Activities and Constitutional
                    Rights. The alternative draft was not found. Hoskinson and Kimmitt forwarded the working group’s paper to
                        Brzezinski and Aaron under cover of a November 22 memorandum.
                    (Carter Library, National Security Council, Institutional Files, 1977–1981, Box
                    99, SCC 119 Intelligence Charters,
                    11/27/78)</p>
            </note>
